'''Sento Cherry Town''' (Japanese: '''セントチェリータウン''' ''St. Cherry Town'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location that was mentioned in ''[[EP272|Johto Photo Finish]]''. It is the [[hometown]] of [[Jon Dickson]], the winner of the [[Silver Conference]]. It is unknown where it is located, but it is thought to be in [[Johto]].

